<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 18,600 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 18,600 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 18,600 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 18,100 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 15	  January 14</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    18,600		18,100</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $13.192 million	 $3.676 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
